### Qarzdorlik (debt collection) oqimi — bitta kampaniya, bitta raqam, qo'ng'iroq
### IntelliJ IDEA "HTTP Client" bilan ishlaydi: har bir so'rovni ustidagi "Run" tugmasi
### bilan ketma-ket bosing (0 -> 1 -> 2 -> 3 -> 4). Javobdagi id'lar keyingi so'rovga
### avtomatik o'tadi (client.global.set orqali).

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@username = admin
@password = 

### 0. Login — token olish (qolgan so'rovlar shu tokendan foydalanadi)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{username}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.accessToken);
%}


### 1. TTS ovozlar katalogi (ixtiyoriy) — ttsVoice uchun mavjud id'larni ko'rish
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/tts/voices?language=uz-UZ
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 2. Qarzdorlik kampaniyasini yaratish
# Faqat "name" majburiy — qolgani berilmasa default bilan to'ladi
# (defaultLanguage=uz-UZ, dialWindowStart=09:00, dialWindowEnd=20:00,
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/campaigns
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Qarzdorlik — sinov",
  "type": "debt_collection",
  "defaultLanguage": "uz-UZ",
  "dialWindowStart": "00:00",
  "dialWindowEnd": "23:59",
  "maxAttempts": 3,
  "retryIntervalMinutes": 0,
  "maxConcurrentCalls": 1,
  "dailyCallCap": 10
}

> {%
    client.global.set("campaignId", response.body.data.id);
    client.log("Yaratilgan kampaniya id: " + response.body.data.id);
%}

### 3. Qarzdor raqamini nishon sifatida qo'shish
# "phone"ni haqiqiy test raqamiga almashtiring. contextData — agent qo'ng'iroqda
# ishlatadigan faktlar (qarzdor ismi, summa, valyuta, muddat, shartnoma raqami).
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/targets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "clientId": 1001,
    "phone": "998953692029",
    "language": "uz-UZ",
    "contextData": {
      "clientName": "Aziz Karimov",
      "debtAmount": 1500000,
      "currency": "so'm",
      "dueDate": "2026-07-01",
      "contractNumber": "UY-2026-00123"
    }
  }
]

> {%
    client.global.set("targetId", response.body.data.targetIds[0]);
    client.log("Qo'shilgan nishon id: " + response.body.data.targetIds[0]);
%}

### 4. Kampaniyani ishga tushirish — dialer navbatdagi tikida (~5 sek) o'zi chaqiradi
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 5. (kuzatuv) Hozir davom etayotgan qo'ng'iroqlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/calls/live
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 6. (kuzatuv) Kampaniya statistikasi — necha nishon PENDING/DONE, dispositionlar
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/campaigns/{{campaignId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### 7. (kuzatuv) Kampaniyaning qo'ng'iroqlari — natija, transkript uchun callId
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/calls/list
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "page": 0, "size": 20 }


### 8. (ixtiyoriy) Pauza qilish
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/campaigns/{{campaignId}}/pause
# Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### --- Muqobil: kampaniyasiz, darhol bitta qo'lda test qo'ng'irog'i ---
### Dial-oynasi/kunga bog'liq emas, lekin real pul sarflaydi (trunk daqiqasi).

### 9. Qo'lda qo'ng'iroq boshlash
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calls?number=998953692029
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

> {%
    client.global.set("channelId", response.body.data.channelId);
%}

### 10. Ulangan kanalga qarzdorlik matnini o'qitish (test uchun)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/calls/{{channelId}}/say?text=Assalomu alaykum, sizda 1 500 000 som qarz mavjud&language=uz-UZ
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
